WEBVTT

01:41.380 --> 01:45.960
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.640 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 30]

01:49.560 --> 01:50.870
So you're the real Mu Qingge.

01:51.479 --> 01:52.280
Don't worry.

01:52.640 --> 01:54.200
I'll deal with Su Yishui first.

01:54.310 --> 01:55.280
Then we'll settle the score

01:55.310 --> 01:56.310
in the previous life.

02:26.800 --> 02:27.360
Master,

02:27.630 --> 02:28.360
what happened?

02:29.840 --> 02:31.150
Why has Wei Jiu's power increased so much?

02:33.310 --> 02:33.960
Because

02:34.400 --> 02:36.150
in the netherworld, the natural order is reversed.

02:36.370 --> 02:37.440
Su Yishui, the more powerful you are

02:37.470 --> 02:38.280
in the mortal world,

02:38.520 --> 02:39.240
the more

02:39.560 --> 02:40.750
you are suppressed in the netherworld.

02:47.120 --> 02:47.910
I see.

02:48.120 --> 02:49.240
So in the netherworld,

02:49.560 --> 02:50.560
I'm actually the strongest.

02:51.960 --> 02:52.520
Master,

02:53.030 --> 02:53.750
in the netherworld,

02:54.079 --> 02:54.870
let me protect you.

02:59.870 --> 03:00.520
What's that?

03:12.960 --> 03:13.910
Ranran, Yishui,

03:14.680 --> 03:15.840
these devil beasts are tough to deal with.

03:16.000 --> 03:16.750
They won't stop until we're dead.

03:16.910 --> 03:17.590
We can't get rid of them at all.

03:18.010 --> 03:18.630
Follow me.

03:20.430 --> 03:21.000
What should we do?

03:21.670 --> 03:22.480
What else can we do?

03:53.960 --> 03:54.800
Thank you both.

03:56.360 --> 03:57.360
Scarlet Sect has long documented

03:57.470 --> 03:58.590
the netherworld's devil beasts.

03:59.460 --> 04:00.550
Unless you can instantly

04:00.630 --> 04:01.630
teleport beyond one mile,

04:02.280 --> 04:03.520
you can never escape their pursuit.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.400
The material for these golden talismans is rare.

04:08.680 --> 04:09.680
Even Eternal Sect can only make

04:09.680 --> 04:11.150
seven or eight talismans a year.

04:11.430 --> 04:12.520
Yet you have so many.

04:14.400 --> 04:15.550
The teleportation talismans are hard to craft.

04:15.840 --> 04:17.040
It took me a long time

04:17.040 --> 04:17.750
to draw them.

04:18.040 --> 04:19.160
But there are too many of us.

04:19.589 --> 04:20.940
We can't possibly teleport beyond one mile.

04:21.350 --> 04:22.670
The devil beasts will still catch up to us.

04:28.190 --> 04:29.160
You let your guard down

04:29.190 --> 04:30.310
after the sudden surge of your power?

04:31.270 --> 04:32.040
Su Yishui,

04:32.720 --> 04:33.720
give me the Spirit Spring.

04:38.320 --> 04:39.720
You actually borrowed Xue Ranran's power!

04:39.750 --> 04:41.390
One wisp of qi to break the galaxy!

04:47.270 --> 04:47.800
My Lord!

04:48.830 --> 04:49.720
Thanks to you all,

04:50.380 --> 04:50.970
those devil beasts

04:51.000 --> 04:52.270
will surely attack this place again.

04:55.510 --> 04:56.430
He has done many evil things.

04:56.800 --> 04:57.270
Today,

04:57.290 --> 04:58.070
I'll eliminate this devil first.

04:58.070 --> 04:59.120
Immortal Yan, please spare him.

04:59.760 --> 05:01.440
What happened just now was our fault.

05:02.000 --> 05:03.390
I'm willing to help you all get out of here.

05:03.960 --> 05:04.570
Please

05:04.600 --> 05:05.600
don't hurt His Lordship.

05:11.510 --> 05:12.560
I learned a secret technique,

05:12.800 --> 05:13.720
which can temporarily enhance

05:13.720 --> 05:14.510
the power of magical tools and talismans.

05:15.720 --> 05:16.630
I beg for your mercy!

05:20.830 --> 05:21.630
We can't delay any longer!

05:24.600 --> 05:25.510
Then we'll do as you said.

05:55.430 --> 05:56.430
We've finally escaped.

06:01.430 --> 06:02.040
Elder Tu,

06:02.560 --> 06:03.430
your arm...

06:03.870 --> 06:05.070
A secret technique always comes at a price.

06:06.190 --> 06:07.270
Now that we're out of danger,

06:08.160 --> 06:09.360
please keep your promise.

06:12.240 --> 06:12.870
This pill

06:13.160 --> 06:14.270
was made by me.

06:14.800 --> 06:15.920
It has remarkable healing effects.

06:18.120 --> 06:18.590
Thank you.

06:26.120 --> 06:26.680
Wei Jiu,

06:27.310 --> 06:28.160
if it weren't for Elder Tu

06:28.190 --> 06:28.950
helping us escape,

06:29.160 --> 06:30.240
you'd be dead by now.

06:31.430 --> 06:32.630
The netherworld corrodes flesh and blood.

06:32.800 --> 06:33.630
She's badly injured.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.480
You should take her back to the mortal world

06:35.510 --> 06:36.480
to recover as soon as possible.

06:37.040 --> 06:38.000
The peak over there

06:38.510 --> 06:39.510
is the exit of the netherworld.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.480
You two should also go back as soon as possible.

06:43.270 --> 06:43.720
Ranran,

06:44.120 --> 06:44.560
let's go.

06:50.750 --> 06:51.270
Wen,

06:52.070 --> 06:53.120
you go back to the mortal world first.

06:53.400 --> 06:54.310
I still have something to do.

06:55.240 --> 06:55.950
What is it?

06:56.810 --> 06:58.020
The devil beasts at the foot of the mountain

06:58.070 --> 06:58.870
haven't given up yet.

06:59.600 --> 07:00.600
It's easy for us to escape,

07:01.090 --> 07:02.330
but Su Yishui and Xue Ranran

07:02.360 --> 07:03.160
are still here.

07:04.000 --> 07:04.680
I need to lure

07:04.950 --> 07:06.070
the devil beasts away from them.

07:06.680 --> 07:07.240
I'll go too.

07:08.390 --> 07:08.800
No.

07:09.020 --> 07:09.550
You can't just

07:09.580 --> 07:10.900
spout those noble words

07:11.200 --> 07:12.130
and leave me here

07:12.160 --> 07:13.000
to be a coward, right?

07:14.270 --> 07:14.800
Wen.

07:30.870 --> 07:31.480
You're injured?

07:32.510 --> 07:33.040
Let me take a look.

07:34.920 --> 07:36.600
The scent of flesh and blood will attract devil beasts.

07:37.190 --> 07:37.870
There's no need to look.

07:39.830 --> 07:40.920
Xue Ranran said

07:41.159 --> 07:42.120
you are badly injured

07:42.600 --> 07:43.560
and need to go back to the mortal world to recover.

07:44.390 --> 07:45.040
Is that true?

07:45.830 --> 07:46.600
If I want you

07:46.630 --> 07:47.680
to take me back immediately,

07:48.360 --> 07:49.510
would you do so?

07:58.040 --> 07:58.510
No.

07:59.800 --> 08:00.560
After all these years,

08:00.920 --> 08:02.000
I've finally gotten close to the Spirit Spring.

08:03.040 --> 08:03.870
Even if I can't obtain it,

08:04.240 --> 08:04.870
I must use the Spirit Spring

08:04.870 --> 08:05.870
to cleanse the Blazing Sword

08:06.190 --> 08:07.420
in order to revive Celestial Sect.

08:13.720 --> 08:14.560
How are you really?

08:17.390 --> 08:18.040
I'm fine.

08:19.040 --> 08:20.360
I was just joking just now.

08:22.310 --> 08:23.160
My Lord, just go.

08:23.430 --> 08:25.270
If you delay any longer, Su Yishui will seal the Spirit Spring,

08:25.480 --> 08:26.240
and you won't have a chance.

08:26.750 --> 08:27.190
But you...

08:35.659 --> 08:36.730
Just stay here obediently

08:37.480 --> 08:38.080
and wait for me to return.

08:58.790 --> 09:00.390
You already knew his choice.

09:01.570 --> 09:02.780
Why bother asking?

09:04.720 --> 09:05.670
Tu Jiuyuan,

09:07.150 --> 09:08.110
time to give up.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.530
I finally found it.

10:07.080 --> 10:07.750
This is the place.

10:09.870 --> 10:11.000
This ancient formation

10:12.630 --> 10:14.030
relies on the extreme cold of the Falling Water

10:14.360 --> 10:15.240
to petrify, freeze, and seal

10:15.270 --> 10:16.840
the Spirit Spring.

10:17.840 --> 10:18.440
Master,

10:19.270 --> 10:20.720
do your best to seal the Spirit Spring.

10:21.150 --> 10:21.960
I'll guard you.

11:17.030 --> 11:17.600
No!

11:31.080 --> 11:31.510
Seal!

11:34.670 --> 11:35.390
Stop!

11:35.870 --> 11:36.960
You are the demon's child.

11:37.240 --> 11:38.440
What you want is the universe.

11:38.900 --> 11:39.690
If you seal me,

11:39.720 --> 11:41.120
you'll regret it!

11:41.270 --> 11:42.360
With two more drops,

11:43.630 --> 11:45.440
you'll be eternally sealed in this formation.

11:48.320 --> 11:49.720
The descendant of Demonic Sect hiding over there,

11:50.120 --> 11:51.150
help me!

12:04.000 --> 12:04.510
Wei Jiu,

12:04.750 --> 12:05.510
you've gone back on your word.

12:05.670 --> 12:06.440
What are you going to do?

12:06.510 --> 12:07.670
You'll find out later.

12:10.150 --> 12:11.270
Your disciples and descendants

12:11.870 --> 12:12.670
can't save you anymore.

12:13.870 --> 12:15.320
Mu Qingge's Golden Core?

12:15.720 --> 12:16.840
It's been so many years,

12:17.200 --> 12:18.390
yet it still has power.

12:19.930 --> 12:21.360
Back then, to seal you,

12:21.750 --> 12:23.000
she removed this Golden Core.

12:23.630 --> 12:24.910
Now, with success so close,

12:25.320 --> 12:26.630
I will certainly do my best!

12:26.940 --> 12:27.450
Seal!

12:45.240 --> 12:45.960
Su Yishui,

12:46.730 --> 12:47.690
if you still have

12:47.720 --> 12:48.790
any shred of our master-disciple bond,

12:49.550 --> 12:50.790
just promise me one thing.

12:51.480 --> 12:52.960
I've sealed the Spirit Spring at Wangxiang Pass.

12:53.720 --> 12:55.240
Return it to the netherworld for me.

12:57.480 --> 12:58.870
I'm about to accomplish it.

13:01.790 --> 13:03.200
Only one more drop to go!

13:21.610 --> 13:22.450
Finally, you've drawn

13:22.480 --> 13:23.360
on the formation's power

13:23.380 --> 13:24.710
to seal the Spirit Spring.

13:26.630 --> 13:27.720
Now I can finally

13:27.750 --> 13:29.080
release my senior.

13:43.180 --> 13:44.570
It's indeed Uncle Ye Xin.

13:48.840 --> 13:50.120
It's been so many years.

13:50.630 --> 13:51.750
I'm finally free.

13:54.630 --> 13:55.960
Thank you for your help, Wu.

13:56.390 --> 13:57.150
Congratulations.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.240
Long time no see,

14:04.510 --> 14:05.080
Qingge.

14:05.870 --> 14:06.270
No.

14:07.670 --> 14:08.790
I guess you don't remember me.

14:09.550 --> 14:10.670
Now I should call you

14:11.150 --> 14:12.630
Xue Ranran instead.

14:19.750 --> 14:20.750
There's a booklet here.

14:24.840 --> 14:26.600
This must be Uncle Ye Xin's portrait.

14:33.240 --> 14:33.790
Guess

14:34.360 --> 14:34.910
who I will

14:35.000 --> 14:35.720
give this to.

14:36.030 --> 14:36.480
Me.

14:36.670 --> 14:37.320
Me.

14:39.790 --> 14:40.360
It's yours.

14:42.320 --> 14:42.790
Qingge.

14:43.910 --> 14:44.670
I didn't expect you

14:45.080 --> 14:46.600
to venture into the netherworld.

14:46.750 --> 14:47.480
Uncle Ye Xin.

14:52.550 --> 14:53.120
Qingge,

14:54.120 --> 14:55.200
give me the Spirit Spring.

14:58.960 --> 14:59.440
You

15:00.550 --> 15:02.750
are Uncle Ye Xin who raised Mu Qingge.

15:03.630 --> 15:04.480
You're also the fallen immortal

15:04.500 --> 15:05.670
who stopped her from sealing the Spirit Spring.

15:06.030 --> 15:06.910
Exactly.

15:07.840 --> 15:08.360
Ranran!

15:08.720 --> 15:10.030
He's dangerous. Don't go near him!

15:11.870 --> 15:13.120
It was Mu Qingge

15:13.150 --> 15:14.390
who sealed me here

15:14.980 --> 15:16.380
and stopped me from obtaining the Spirit Spring.

15:16.960 --> 15:17.510
Now,

15:17.840 --> 15:19.200
I'll obtain it from him!

15:20.630 --> 15:21.360
I don't care who you are.

15:21.550 --> 15:22.840
No one is allowed to disturb my master!

15:23.240 --> 15:23.790
Fine.

15:24.080 --> 15:25.360
I'm going to kill you right now!

15:27.670 --> 15:28.270
Ranran!

15:31.030 --> 15:31.600
Master!

15:32.080 --> 15:33.390
We went through so much

15:33.390 --> 15:34.000
to get here!

15:34.150 --> 15:34.910
Our effort can't be wasted!

15:35.600 --> 15:36.840
You must seal the Spirit Spring.

15:37.200 --> 15:38.120
Leave him to me!

15:55.630 --> 15:56.080
Ranran!

16:01.200 --> 16:01.790
Ranran!

16:04.960 --> 16:05.550
Master,

16:05.630 --> 16:06.480
don't be distracted!

16:06.790 --> 16:07.840
I have a technique to borrow power.

16:08.000 --> 16:08.750
I can hold on!

16:30.740 --> 16:31.340
Seal!

18:16.860 --> 18:17.450
Ranran!

18:22.350 --> 18:22.880
Master!

18:26.240 --> 18:27.030
Are you alright?

18:37.010 --> 18:37.590
Oh no.

18:38.350 --> 18:39.480
The gate of the netherworld is closing.

18:46.680 --> 18:47.350
Ranran!

18:47.590 --> 18:48.440
Sealing the Spirit Spring

18:48.550 --> 18:50.000
really makes me angry.

18:51.250 --> 18:52.420
But it doesn't matter.

18:52.710 --> 18:54.360
Now let's play another game.

19:23.000 --> 19:23.550
Master!

19:33.750 --> 19:34.550
Master,

19:35.350 --> 19:36.310
you're so nice.

19:44.110 --> 19:44.790
Master!

19:45.000 --> 19:45.720
Are you alright?

19:55.790 --> 19:56.400
Where is she?

19:57.880 --> 19:58.920
Could it be the devil beasts got her?

20:01.310 --> 20:02.240
The formation flag is intact.

20:02.390 --> 20:03.420
She should be safe.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.310
She actually left first!

20:10.160 --> 20:11.640
I specially took a detour to come back to her,

20:11.880 --> 20:12.480
but she

20:12.590 --> 20:13.550
left without me!

20:17.400 --> 20:18.350
I'll settle the score with her later.

20:22.520 --> 20:23.210
[The exit of the netherworld]

20:27.830 --> 20:28.440
Master.

20:42.590 --> 20:43.160
Who are you?

20:43.480 --> 20:44.830
Why do you have my spiritual power's energy?

20:45.240 --> 20:46.110
Master,

20:46.830 --> 20:47.720
what's wrong with you?

21:13.170 --> 21:14.320
No one can stop me

21:14.350 --> 21:15.790
from standing at the pinnacle of this world.

21:16.510 --> 21:17.270
Mu Qingge,

21:17.750 --> 21:18.880
I'll kill you right now!

21:21.830 --> 21:22.680
Master,

21:23.110 --> 21:23.750
you're awake.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.350
Master.

21:32.640 --> 21:33.310
Who are you guys?

21:33.790 --> 21:34.510
You called me Master.

21:34.590 --> 21:35.440
What trick are you playing?

21:37.790 --> 21:38.400
Master.

21:44.720 --> 21:45.240
Master!

21:45.370 --> 21:45.850
Master!

21:45.880 --> 21:46.510
Master!

21:46.640 --> 21:47.110
Why?

21:47.750 --> 21:48.960
You have no power at all,

21:49.270 --> 21:50.550
but why do you have my spiritual power's energy?

21:50.720 --> 21:51.270
Who are you?

21:52.000 --> 21:53.310
Don't you recognize me anymore?

21:54.030 --> 21:54.720
Answer me!

21:55.480 --> 21:56.640
You gave me

21:57.310 --> 21:58.440
the spiritual power yourself

21:58.750 --> 21:59.790
in order to save me.

22:00.590 --> 22:01.880
Who do you think I am?

22:06.440 --> 22:07.160
It's her.

22:08.200 --> 22:09.440
You're all her accomplices!

22:10.960 --> 22:11.550
Mu Qingge!

22:11.920 --> 22:12.720
Show yourself!

22:17.880 --> 22:18.680
You won't come out?

22:19.310 --> 22:20.000
Fine.

22:20.320 --> 22:21.210
I'll kill you

22:21.240 --> 22:22.200
and take back my spiritual power first!

22:23.510 --> 22:24.160
Master!

22:24.440 --> 22:25.030
Guardian!

22:26.510 --> 22:27.680
You can't do this.

22:29.590 --> 22:30.160
Yu Tong?

22:30.350 --> 22:30.920
Yu Chen?

22:32.830 --> 22:33.720
It's us.

22:34.030 --> 22:35.200
Guardian, you still remember us.

22:35.550 --> 22:37.000
Why have you grown so much?

22:38.520 --> 22:40.320
Haven't we... always been by your side,

22:40.350 --> 22:41.030
serving you?

22:43.310 --> 22:44.400
May I ask you a question, Guardian?

22:45.000 --> 22:46.240
What year do you think it is now?

22:46.480 --> 22:47.640
The 47th year of Fengping.

22:49.590 --> 22:50.200
Guardian,

22:50.590 --> 22:52.110
it's now the 19th year of Zhengyong.

22:52.400 --> 22:53.590
From the year you said,

22:53.830 --> 22:55.160
23 years have passed.

23:06.200 --> 23:06.680
Ranran,

23:07.110 --> 23:07.830
are you okay?

23:08.440 --> 23:09.310
Are you hurt?

23:11.590 --> 23:12.590
Just now, it looked like

23:13.200 --> 23:14.790
Master really wanted to kill you.

23:16.590 --> 23:17.830
What on earth happened to Master?

23:18.480 --> 23:19.480
It was Ye Xin.

23:20.200 --> 23:21.680
In the end, he used the Falling Water to draw a talisman,

23:21.800 --> 23:23.080
but he didn't hurt Master.

23:23.900 --> 23:25.450
There must be something wrong with that talisman.

23:26.070 --> 23:27.270
I'll ask Alcohol Immortal

23:27.750 --> 23:28.830
to see what kind of evil magic it is.

23:38.240 --> 23:38.720
I won.

23:40.720 --> 23:41.510
It doesn't count.

23:41.880 --> 23:42.480
I drowsed when I

23:44.550 --> 23:45.200
made the previous move.

23:45.550 --> 23:46.310
Let's play again.

23:46.720 --> 23:48.160
Once a move is made, there's no turning back. You should admit defeat.

23:48.270 --> 23:49.280
We had a deal.

23:49.310 --> 23:50.690
Whoever wins the last round

23:50.720 --> 23:52.680
gets the last jar of Mistaken Divine brewed by Ranran.

23:53.920 --> 23:54.430
Liang,

23:55.310 --> 23:56.400
in the first half of this round,

23:56.400 --> 23:57.270
I had the upper hand.

23:57.830 --> 23:58.240
How about

23:58.310 --> 23:59.240
splitting the wine 50-50?

23:59.640 --> 24:00.310
You're trying to cheat?

24:00.310 --> 24:00.720
No!

24:00.830 --> 24:02.160
I... I'm telling the truth!

24:02.240 --> 24:03.200
At least in the first half,

24:03.240 --> 24:04.590
I had the upper hand!

24:04.680 --> 24:05.510
So give me

24:05.510 --> 24:06.680
half of it, okay?

24:06.720 --> 24:07.160
Give it to me.

24:08.720 --> 24:09.240
Put the wine down first.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.200
Let's hear what Ranran has to say.

24:10.550 --> 24:11.750
We still need her to brew wine for us in the future.

24:17.510 --> 24:18.680
Su Yishui has suddenly forgotten

24:18.880 --> 24:20.440
everything that happened in the past 20-odd years.

24:23.920 --> 24:24.510
Doesn't that mean

24:24.510 --> 24:25.680
he's even forgotten

24:25.700 --> 24:26.620
about causing Mu's death?

24:27.000 --> 24:27.720
This guy

24:28.200 --> 24:29.790
is so heartless, even when he lost his memory!

24:31.110 --> 24:31.960
Ranran said

24:32.200 --> 24:33.830
someone used a drop of the Falling Water,

24:34.240 --> 24:35.880
and then Su Yishui couldn't remember anything.

24:36.290 --> 24:37.700
Do you remember any talisman that needs to be drawn

24:37.720 --> 24:38.570
with the Falling Water?

24:38.960 --> 24:39.830
The Falling Water

24:39.850 --> 24:41.280
isn't something from the mortal world.

24:41.830 --> 24:42.790
Who would use it?

24:44.960 --> 24:45.640
Unless...

24:47.110 --> 24:47.880
he's not from the mortal world.

24:48.200 --> 24:48.790
Are you drunk?

24:49.350 --> 24:50.110
Isn't that obvious?

24:52.720 --> 24:54.160
My brother knew I was good at talismans.

24:54.510 --> 24:55.610
Before he attained ascension,

24:55.640 --> 24:57.200
he copied two talismans from the Immortal Realm for me.

24:57.590 --> 24:58.270
But they are

24:58.270 --> 24:59.200
impractical talismans

24:59.220 --> 25:00.380
requiring rare materials.

25:02.550 --> 25:03.030
Liang.

25:05.000 --> 25:05.790
Where are they?

25:07.590 --> 25:08.680
Hurry up and look for them.

25:09.240 --> 25:10.070
If we help Ranran,

25:10.110 --> 25:11.640
it'll be easier to ask her for wine in the future.

25:12.160 --> 25:12.640
That's right.

25:13.110 --> 25:14.030
I'm going to look for them now!

25:30.000 --> 25:31.440
You asked some quacks to talk nonsense here.

25:31.830 --> 25:32.720
I don't have any injuries or illnesses!

25:33.350 --> 25:34.350
But Guardian,

25:35.110 --> 25:36.640
you have indeed forgotten a lot.

25:36.830 --> 25:38.110
Mu Qingge did this to me!

25:38.310 --> 25:39.070
Where exactly is she?

25:39.590 --> 25:40.200
She's dead.

25:42.240 --> 25:42.960
Dead?

25:43.750 --> 25:44.030
Yes.

25:44.270 --> 25:45.200
Dead.

25:46.790 --> 25:47.510
How did she die?

25:49.200 --> 25:50.480
Nineteen years ago,

25:50.750 --> 25:51.610
the four Heavenly Sects

25:51.640 --> 25:52.880
created the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Curse.

25:53.280 --> 25:54.170
They lured Mu Qingge

25:54.200 --> 25:55.160
into the formation and killed her.

25:58.720 --> 25:59.830
She kidnapped me to Mount Wester

26:00.110 --> 26:01.160
and made me suffer all kinds of humiliation.

26:01.720 --> 26:02.920
Not being able to kill her with my own hands

26:03.160 --> 26:04.240
is truly letting her off easy.

26:08.240 --> 26:09.350
Those Westers

26:09.350 --> 26:10.480
claim to be my disciples.

26:11.400 --> 26:12.000
Now, I've taken over

26:12.030 --> 26:13.200
Mu Qingge's Mount Wester?

26:13.480 --> 26:14.030
Yes.

26:14.550 --> 26:15.310
Guardian, now

26:15.330 --> 26:16.230
you are the sovereign of Wester Sect.

26:19.160 --> 26:20.510
Then set out for Mount Wester tomorrow

26:21.880 --> 26:23.510
to search Mu Qingge's territory

26:24.030 --> 26:25.510
and see what exactly she did to me.

26:26.790 --> 26:27.350
Bring those

26:27.350 --> 26:28.510
who claim to be my disciples along,

26:28.920 --> 26:29.550
especially the one

26:29.550 --> 26:30.510
who has my spiritual power.

26:30.880 --> 26:31.790
We absolutely can't let her escape.

26:34.590 --> 26:35.480
-Yes.
-Yes.

26:39.310 --> 26:39.880
Senior Gao,

26:41.110 --> 26:42.310
please escort them out first.

26:42.590 --> 26:43.070
Okay.

26:43.880 --> 26:44.640
Gentlemen, please.

27:01.720 --> 27:02.400
How is he?

27:03.900 --> 27:04.940
He still can't remember.

27:05.240 --> 27:06.000
Unlike the rest of us,

27:06.830 --> 27:08.030
Ranran, you need to be extra careful.

27:08.520 --> 27:09.510
Guardian's memory

27:09.590 --> 27:11.540
seems to be stuck at the time when he was just abducted

27:12.000 --> 27:13.830
and obsessed with killing Mu Qingge for revenge.

27:15.480 --> 27:17.030
I know I must conceal my identity.

27:17.850 --> 27:20.130
If he finds out I'm Mu Qingge now,

27:20.200 --> 27:21.720
he'll surely kill me and tear me into pieces.

27:22.400 --> 27:24.240
Guardian said he wants to visit Mount Wester tomorrow

27:24.550 --> 27:25.720
to find the reason for his memory loss.

27:26.400 --> 27:28.510
He still believes Mu Qingge is behind all this.

27:31.070 --> 27:31.480
That's fine.

27:32.400 --> 27:33.550
Mount Wester has many immortal herbs.

27:34.000 --> 27:35.640
I also want to make some pills as soon as possible

27:36.440 --> 27:37.960
to see if I can help him.

27:38.590 --> 27:40.240
But with Guardian's current temperament,

27:40.270 --> 27:41.720
if he sees those things on Mount Wester,

27:42.640 --> 27:43.790
who knows what he might do?

27:45.030 --> 27:46.270
It might not be a bad thing.

27:47.110 --> 27:48.000
Since it's amnesia,

27:48.200 --> 27:49.510
more exposure to things from the past

27:49.830 --> 27:50.920
will always be of some help.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.680
What we can do now

27:53.200 --> 27:54.920
is to avoid making him angry

27:55.240 --> 27:56.240
and wait and see.

28:20.030 --> 28:20.620
How does it taste?

28:26.480 --> 28:28.110
I always complained about the unfairness of fate,

28:28.720 --> 28:30.200
but actually, what I've longed for all my life

28:31.790 --> 28:32.720
has always been by my side.

28:44.880 --> 28:46.400
Everything was fine before.

28:47.510 --> 28:48.720
Why did he become

28:49.440 --> 28:51.000
a completely different person within just one day?

29:13.640 --> 29:14.350
Xue Ranran!

29:15.720 --> 29:16.160
Yes.

29:17.160 --> 29:18.200
I just performed my inner energy circulation

29:18.550 --> 29:20.070
and found that I've reached the Transcendence Stage.

29:20.550 --> 29:21.440
And you

29:21.790 --> 29:22.920
have half of my core.

29:23.510 --> 29:24.750
Now, tell me,

29:25.400 --> 29:27.000
since I've finally reached the Transcendence Stage,

29:27.410 --> 29:28.450
why would I give my core

29:28.480 --> 29:28.920
to you,

29:28.920 --> 29:29.830
a worthless person with no power?

29:31.720 --> 29:32.590
What trick did you play?

29:35.510 --> 29:36.640
No need to play a trick.

29:37.510 --> 29:38.720
You did that

29:39.510 --> 29:41.030
because of our deep bond.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.350
Deep bond?

29:44.000 --> 29:44.640
With you?

29:45.310 --> 29:45.920
That's right.

29:46.640 --> 29:47.350
If you don't believe me,

29:47.880 --> 29:49.540
Master, why don't you look at what you're wearing

29:49.590 --> 29:50.440
and the furnishings in the room?

29:51.970 --> 29:53.080
The sandalwood scent on your clothes

29:53.110 --> 29:54.030
was infused by me.

29:55.310 --> 29:56.680
The tasseled mugwort was picked by me.

29:57.570 --> 29:58.290
That wooden hairpin

29:58.400 --> 29:59.240
was also made by me.

30:03.400 --> 30:04.000
And this.

30:04.310 --> 30:04.880
The dried longan

30:04.880 --> 30:06.270
was also made by me personally.

30:06.960 --> 30:07.830
How dare you insult me!

30:13.440 --> 30:13.830
Get out!

30:41.150 --> 30:43.530
[Jingyang Hall]

30:51.510 --> 30:52.070
Yu.

30:53.030 --> 30:54.000
We meet again.

30:54.750 --> 30:55.880
Why are you here?

30:57.070 --> 30:57.920
Don't be surprised.

30:58.880 --> 31:00.070
Since I could come here

31:00.070 --> 31:00.750
unimpeded,

31:01.480 --> 31:02.750
of course I have someone to help me.

31:03.720 --> 31:04.590
Someone to help you?

31:06.290 --> 31:07.450
A powerful person

31:07.480 --> 31:08.880
who can cure you.

31:10.310 --> 31:11.160
Feng,

31:12.350 --> 31:13.310
what's going on?

31:17.110 --> 31:19.590
Master Mu, at the request of me,

31:19.830 --> 31:21.270
has brought that powerful person here.

31:22.310 --> 31:23.750
I spent so many years in the netherworld.

31:24.310 --> 31:24.880
Today,

31:25.590 --> 31:27.000
I'm finally free again

31:28.200 --> 31:29.200
to meet you, Your Highness.

31:31.400 --> 31:32.880
But honestly,

31:33.200 --> 31:35.000
I'm not exactly a stranger to you.

31:35.400 --> 31:36.000
After all,

31:36.160 --> 31:37.200
a part of me

31:37.440 --> 31:39.400
has been by your side for many years.

31:41.640 --> 31:42.110
You...

31:43.480 --> 31:44.590
You... You are...

31:44.790 --> 31:45.440
one person?

31:47.830 --> 31:49.510
Feng is a fragment of my being.

31:50.030 --> 31:50.880
But now,

31:51.240 --> 31:52.400
he is no longer important.

32:08.640 --> 32:09.400
Previously,

32:09.830 --> 32:11.480
I was sealed in the netherworld by Mu Qingge.

32:12.200 --> 32:12.960
I only left

32:13.110 --> 32:14.110
a fragment of my being in this world.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.720
At that time, I already knew

32:16.110 --> 32:16.960
in this world,

32:17.110 --> 32:18.590
only you can help me.

32:19.200 --> 32:19.750
So,

32:20.400 --> 32:21.680
I transformed into Feng

32:22.070 --> 32:23.510
and stayed by your side.

32:26.000 --> 32:26.750
Who are you?

32:29.590 --> 32:30.480
He is

32:31.080 --> 32:32.520
Uncle Ye Xin, the otherworldly master

32:32.830 --> 32:33.830
who raised

32:34.590 --> 32:35.310
me and Qingge.

32:41.070 --> 32:42.830
So I became

32:43.880 --> 32:45.920
a part of your game long ago?

32:48.830 --> 32:49.920
Come to think of it,

32:50.510 --> 32:51.920
everything Feng did before

32:52.960 --> 32:55.070
was all part of your scheme.

32:55.880 --> 32:57.480
So, I've ended up like this

32:59.110 --> 33:01.000
because I made a pact with the devil.

33:02.570 --> 33:04.520
Now you actually dare to swagger

33:04.550 --> 33:05.790
before me.

33:07.550 --> 33:09.480
Do you really think the Eastern Palace has no one to defend against you?

33:10.200 --> 33:11.510
You are a smart person.

33:12.110 --> 33:13.880
If I just used some mundane magic,

33:14.440 --> 33:15.350
how could I have deceived you

33:15.350 --> 33:16.110
for so many years?

33:16.590 --> 33:18.920
But today, with my true form here,

33:19.350 --> 33:20.790
I do not wish to be your enemy.

33:21.510 --> 33:22.160
Instead,

33:22.920 --> 33:23.960
I want to cooperate with you.

33:26.550 --> 33:27.590
Cooperate with

33:28.070 --> 33:29.920
a scheming person like you?

33:30.720 --> 33:31.720
What a joke!

33:34.880 --> 33:35.720
Unless...

33:36.720 --> 33:37.510
you show me

33:38.550 --> 33:39.960
your sincerity.

33:40.750 --> 33:41.680
After all,

33:42.240 --> 33:43.440
you want something from me,

33:44.350 --> 33:45.030
right?

33:46.070 --> 33:46.960
Then what do you think

33:47.400 --> 33:49.110
I want from you?

33:50.750 --> 33:51.630
I don't know.

33:52.550 --> 33:54.310
After all, for a capable person like you,

33:55.200 --> 33:56.680
both money and power

33:57.350 --> 33:58.590
are within your easy reach.

33:59.440 --> 34:00.750
You would never

34:01.110 --> 34:02.270
stay by my side for them.

34:02.680 --> 34:04.720
You tried to make the Spirit Spring stay in Su Yishui's body.

34:05.350 --> 34:07.400
You failed, yet you still came back to me.

34:07.920 --> 34:09.110
That means I have

34:10.000 --> 34:12.070
something you desperately want.

34:13.480 --> 34:14.710
You are indeed clever.

34:39.199 --> 34:40.120
I used magic

34:40.150 --> 34:41.920
to forcibly reverse your lifespan.

34:42.590 --> 34:43.230
Within

34:43.760 --> 34:44.630
the next six months,

34:44.960 --> 34:45.760
your body

34:46.230 --> 34:47.400
will be like it is today.

34:47.510 --> 34:48.360
What will happen in six months?

34:48.800 --> 34:49.440
In six months,

34:49.760 --> 34:51.219
if our plan works,

34:51.760 --> 34:53.449
your body will still be like this.

34:53.630 --> 34:54.469
Also,

34:54.790 --> 34:55.520
you can have

34:55.550 --> 34:57.110
the power to make everything start anew,

34:57.590 --> 34:58.280
including

34:58.760 --> 35:00.030
the past you regret

35:00.860 --> 35:01.530
and

35:01.960 --> 35:03.480
the power you can't obtain,

35:04.070 --> 35:04.710
as well as...

35:07.320 --> 35:08.190
Mu Qingge.

35:09.190 --> 35:11.110
Everything will be under your control.

35:15.230 --> 35:16.440
Tell me about your plan.

35:31.150 --> 35:32.590
A nobody

35:33.290 --> 35:33.810
like Ye Xin

35:33.840 --> 35:35.280
couldn't possibly know

35:35.920 --> 35:37.000
those mysterious things.

35:38.780 --> 35:39.900
Who are you really?

35:41.510 --> 35:42.630
I am Dun Tian.

35:48.000 --> 35:49.070
You are the founder

35:49.190 --> 35:50.150
of Eternal Sect

35:50.400 --> 35:51.550
and the greatest immortal master in the universe?

35:52.030 --> 35:53.540
But Dun Tian attained ascension

35:53.710 --> 35:54.800
a few hundred years ago.

35:55.760 --> 35:57.320
Why did you disguise yourself as Uncle Ye Xin?

35:58.150 --> 35:59.320
In everyone's heart,

36:00.360 --> 36:01.960
there are things they regret.

36:04.230 --> 36:05.110
I am no exception.

36:07.320 --> 36:08.480
Mother, you made chicken drumsticks?

36:08.510 --> 36:09.550
They smell so good.

36:10.110 --> 36:10.630
Honey,

36:11.110 --> 36:11.710
time to eat.

36:12.840 --> 36:13.510
I'll be right there.

36:16.000 --> 36:16.550
Sit down.

36:18.750 --> 36:19.410
What a feast.

36:19.440 --> 36:20.670
Why did you cook such a hearty meal today?

36:22.070 --> 36:22.750
Guess

36:23.000 --> 36:24.030
who I'll give

36:24.280 --> 36:25.110
the first chicken drumstick to.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.510
Mother, of course.

36:26.710 --> 36:27.230
Smart girl.

36:29.230 --> 36:29.800
Here.

36:30.880 --> 36:32.150
Your mother must be tired today.

36:36.670 --> 36:37.320
Dun Tian,

36:37.590 --> 36:38.480
if you don't kill our master,

36:38.600 --> 36:39.930
we'll release your wife and children!

36:39.960 --> 36:41.550
Save us! Save us!

36:41.800 --> 36:42.840
Dun Tian!

36:43.160 --> 36:44.680
Save us!

36:44.710 --> 36:45.800
Dun Tian!

36:46.030 --> 36:48.000
Save our children!

36:48.030 --> 36:49.110
Dun Tian!

36:51.110 --> 36:51.920
Dun Tian,

36:52.960 --> 36:54.150
the ultimate way

36:54.670 --> 36:57.590
to attain ascension is killing devils.

36:58.990 --> 37:00.560
If you let Mortal-Demon Lord go,

37:01.120 --> 37:02.040
you will lose

37:02.070 --> 37:04.230
a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

37:04.840 --> 37:05.800
-Father.
-Father.

37:05.880 --> 37:07.880
Think about it carefully.

37:08.920 --> 37:10.840
No! Please don't!

37:15.230 --> 37:16.460
[Immortal Realm]

37:20.800 --> 37:21.920
Is there any news on the matter

37:22.150 --> 37:22.920
I asked you to handle?

37:24.150 --> 37:26.400
You want to bring your loved ones back to life through reincarnation,

37:29.000 --> 37:30.230
but it's truly impossible.

37:31.150 --> 37:32.630
After attaining ascension,

37:33.360 --> 37:35.440
immortals are not allowed to cling to the mortal world.

37:36.710 --> 37:38.230
Even if you obtain the Reincarnation Tree,

37:38.960 --> 37:40.360
you have to gather the souls

37:40.880 --> 37:43.030
of the deceased and perform the ritual within seven days.

37:43.710 --> 37:44.320
Otherwise,

37:44.920 --> 37:46.280
you can't save them.

37:50.590 --> 37:51.230
Dun Tian,

37:52.230 --> 37:53.880
immortals have long lifespans.

37:54.150 --> 37:55.590
When they have nothing to do,

37:56.880 --> 37:58.440
they tend to reminisce about the past.

37:59.230 --> 38:01.360
But you've been an immortal for a few hundred years.

38:02.320 --> 38:03.920
It's too late.

38:05.280 --> 38:06.110
Just let it go.

38:10.110 --> 38:11.630
I will definitely find a way

38:12.510 --> 38:13.960
to reunite with my family,

38:15.280 --> 38:18.670
even if it means making everything start anew.

38:19.960 --> 38:20.960
You said

38:21.230 --> 38:22.320
to make everything start anew

38:23.030 --> 38:24.190
requires a few things.

38:26.440 --> 38:27.760
The most important things

38:28.320 --> 38:29.240
are the Spirit Spring...

38:31.030 --> 38:32.280
and Su Yishui?

38:32.800 --> 38:34.000
That's correct.

38:40.030 --> 38:41.630
What... are you doing?

38:42.890 --> 38:43.420
We're here

38:43.440 --> 38:45.150
to escort the immortal masters of Mount Wester back to the mountain.

38:46.070 --> 38:47.760
The Heavenly Sects truly live up to their names.

38:48.070 --> 38:49.030
They're so generous.

38:49.400 --> 38:49.920
They've hired

38:49.920 --> 38:51.280
all the famous chefs

38:51.550 --> 38:52.320
within 3.33 miles.

38:52.710 --> 38:53.800
What a grand gesture!

38:53.950 --> 38:55.620
Then... who hired you?

38:56.440 --> 38:57.000
I did!

39:05.670 --> 39:06.480
-Master.
-Master.

39:06.920 --> 39:08.320
I've been putting up with living

39:08.710 --> 39:09.800
in such a shabby place.

39:10.500 --> 39:11.730
If I have to be exposed to the elements

39:11.760 --> 39:12.510
and ride a sword when I go out,

39:13.160 --> 39:13.850
how is being an immortal master

39:13.880 --> 39:14.800
any different from being a beggar?

39:15.590 --> 39:16.320
Yu Chen, Yu Tong,

39:16.980 --> 39:17.770
replace the carriage at the entrance

39:17.800 --> 39:18.760
with a gold-decorated one.

39:19.190 --> 39:20.510
We still don't have enough servants or cooks.

39:20.670 --> 39:21.190
Keep looking for more.

39:22.990 --> 39:23.570
-Yes.
-Yes.

39:23.600 --> 39:24.000
Get out of my way!

39:27.920 --> 39:29.760
Master has lost his memory,

39:30.030 --> 39:30.510
but why does it feel like

39:30.510 --> 39:31.670
he's become a completely different person?

39:32.490 --> 39:33.250
When he was at Mount Wester,

39:33.280 --> 39:34.480
he was never this overbearing and extravagant.

39:34.630 --> 39:35.880
Back in the royal residence,

39:36.360 --> 39:37.800
Guardian wasn't like this either.

39:38.550 --> 39:39.630
What on earth happened?

39:40.400 --> 39:41.440
Perhaps since childhood,

39:41.630 --> 39:42.920
he's been living his life cautiously.

39:43.070 --> 39:43.840
He's repressed his feelings for too long,

39:44.440 --> 39:45.550
and now they're all bursting out,

39:46.150 --> 39:47.670
turning him into such an ostentatious person.

39:49.070 --> 39:49.800
He's changed.

39:50.190 --> 39:50.880
Everything has changed.

40:12.480 --> 40:13.320
If this wooden hairpin

40:13.400 --> 40:14.360
is taken away again

40:14.380 --> 40:15.420
by someone...

40:15.800 --> 40:16.400
I won't let that happen.

40:17.030 --> 40:18.320
I promise I'll keep it safe.

40:33.880 --> 40:35.800
Now this is how my servants should look.

40:37.150 --> 40:37.670
Yes.

40:43.190 --> 40:44.000
It's just that...

40:46.360 --> 40:47.110
I'm a little...

40:48.070 --> 40:48.880
not used to this.

40:51.330 --> 40:52.370
Why did Master specially

40:52.400 --> 40:54.070
forbid the four of us to ride in the carriage?

40:55.260 --> 40:57.180
He even told us to stay away from the carriage.

41:00.150 --> 41:01.710
What we're wearing indeed

41:01.710 --> 41:02.960
doesn't match the carriage.

41:03.840 --> 41:05.590
No wonder he wants us to stay away.

41:09.400 --> 41:10.800
My father was defeated and died,

41:10.960 --> 41:11.840
losing the empire.

41:12.700 --> 41:14.220
Yet I came here to teach disciples.

41:15.010 --> 41:15.810
I spent the past ten-odd years

41:15.840 --> 41:17.070
in such an absurd way.

41:17.960 --> 41:19.230
How ridiculous.

41:21.670 --> 41:22.590
There's one more thing.

41:23.710 --> 41:25.230
I'll ask you when we reach Mount Wester.

41:25.850 --> 41:26.770
Think carefully

41:26.800 --> 41:27.480
about how to answer.

41:30.000 --> 41:30.550
Don't forget

41:31.480 --> 41:32.710
I am your guardian.

41:40.410 --> 41:41.560
I've been living in such a shabby place

41:41.590 --> 41:42.710
over the past ten-odd years?

41:45.140 --> 41:46.870
That Consonance Palace we just passed

41:47.230 --> 41:48.440
looks quite luxurious.

41:48.760 --> 41:50.150
We're going to make your palace even better

41:50.320 --> 41:51.480
than the Consonance Palace right now.

41:52.280 --> 41:53.110
We'll talk about that later.

41:53.400 --> 41:54.110
You two,

41:54.400 --> 41:55.280
enter the Consonance Palace with me.

42:10.190 --> 42:10.710
Ranran.

42:12.030 --> 42:13.190
Ranran, you don't have enough spiritual power.

42:13.260 --> 42:14.040
You just came back and you're already making pills.

42:14.070 --> 42:14.960
It's bad for your health.

42:15.630 --> 42:17.070
I want to help Master remember as soon as possible.

42:17.480 --> 42:18.400
Please help me think.

42:18.840 --> 42:20.030
Is there anything else that can help Master

42:20.030 --> 42:20.840
regain his memory?

42:23.760 --> 42:24.760
Delicious food.

42:25.710 --> 42:26.150
Yes.

42:26.510 --> 42:27.800
Master broke his fast

42:27.800 --> 42:28.480
because of your cooking.

42:28.880 --> 42:30.190
He really loves your culinary skills.

42:35.290 --> 42:37.780
[Consonance Palace]

42:46.550 --> 42:47.510
So this is the Consonance Palace

42:47.510 --> 42:48.590
where Mu Qingge lived?

42:49.060 --> 42:49.510
Yes.

42:49.840 --> 42:50.280
Yes.

42:52.480 --> 42:53.320
You two,

42:53.670 --> 42:54.440
when do you plan

42:54.440 --> 42:55.360
to tell me the truth?

42:58.760 --> 43:00.150
You said Mu Qingge is dead,

43:00.630 --> 43:01.590
but in this Consonance Palace,

43:01.840 --> 43:03.190
her spiritual energy still lingers.

43:03.630 --> 43:04.590
And that Xue Ranran,

43:05.000 --> 43:06.190
who is clearly worthless,

43:06.670 --> 43:08.000
somehow has my core.

43:08.840 --> 43:10.280
She even said she and I have a deep bond.

43:10.920 --> 43:12.190
None of this makes sense.

43:12.630 --> 43:14.110
You didn't tell me the truth.

43:14.710 --> 43:15.440
Tell me now

43:15.880 --> 43:17.070
what really happened to Mu Qingge.

43:17.320 --> 43:17.960
Otherwise,

43:18.400 --> 43:19.550
there'll be no need for you two to stay alive.

43:22.000 --> 43:23.150
I dare not hide anything from you!

43:24.030 --> 43:25.550
Mu Qingge did die once.

43:25.890 --> 43:26.520
But

43:26.550 --> 43:27.880
you brought her back to life through reincarnation.

43:28.760 --> 43:30.070
You also placed a restriction on her appearance

43:30.360 --> 43:31.480
so that no one can recognize her.

43:31.760 --> 43:32.320
What?
